Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:01.34,Short,,0,0,0,,An owl can turn its head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.34,0:00:02.14,Short,,0,0,0,,almost all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.12,Short,,0,0,0,,the way around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:04.06,Short,,0,0,0,,It has to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.06,0:00:05.04,Short,,0,0,0,,because its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:06.78,Short,,0,0,0,,aren't balls like ours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:08.20,Short,,0,0,0,,They're long tubes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:09.10,Short,,0,0,0,,locked in place
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:09.70,Short,,0,0,0,,so the head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:10.88,Short,,0,0,0,,does the looking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:11.38,Short,,0,0,0,,That twist
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:11.92,Short,,0,0,0,,would tear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:12.72,Short,,0,0,0,,the blood vessels
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:13.86,Short,,0,0,0,,in your neck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:14.76,Short,,0,0,0,,But an owl has
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.10,Short,,0,0,0,,fourteen neck bones
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.71,Short,,0,0,0,,twice as many as you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:18.28,Short,,0,0,0,,Its arteries
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.34,Short,,0,0,0,,run through holes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:20.54,Short,,0,0,0,,ten times wider
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.41,Short,,0,0,0,,than they are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.41,0:00:22.32,Short,,0,0,0,,cushioned with air
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.04,Short,,0,0,0,,so they never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.21,Short,,0,0,0,,get pinched
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.21,0:00:24.98,Short,,0,0,0,,And under the jaw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:25.68,Short,,0,0,0,,they swell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:26.58,Short,,0,0,0,,into little pools
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:27.14,Short,,0,0,0,,of blood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.14,0:00:28.46,Short,,0,0,0,,that keep the brain fed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:29.72,Short,,0,0,0,,while the head turns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.10,Short,,0,0,0,,So if one ever stares
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:32.22,Short,,0,0,0,,straight behind it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:33.09,Short,,0,0,0,,don't panic
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.09,0:00:33.33,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.00,0:00:29.80,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwith a stiff neck
